# The screen of reference "Slatty's library" (docs/ROADMAP.md) in Steam, on the owner's account, its
# collection "Main", measured by scripts/measure.py as scripts/market.sh runs it. Positions are in
# logical pixels of the window, 2560 x 1440, alone on its output. A cover under the pointer shows
# a card after a moment, as it does for a person.
still
pointer move 251 96        # the view of collections, beside "Home"
sleep 0.6
pointer click
sleep 3
pointer move 621 240       # the collection "Main"
sleep 0.6
pointer click
sleep 3
pointer move 1500 800      # over the grid, where the pointer stays
still
shot open
memory open
measure rest 60
measure scroll 5 every 4.1667 scroll 16    # 16 logical pixels a frame, 1,200 frames
pointer lift               # the fingers leave the touchpad
still
shot scrolled
memory scrolled
pointer move 1400 700      # a game: its page opens, its key art at its head
sleep 0.6
pointer click
still
shot page
memory page
pointer move 32 96         # "Home": the grid and the page close
sleep 0.6
pointer click
sleep 10
shot closed
memory closed
